{"seq":1,"slug":"retries-timeouts-cancellation","title":"重试、超时与取消","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/agent-runtime-reliability/failure-control/retries-timeouts-cancellation","wordCount":2648,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"重试-超时与取消\">重试、超时与取消</h1><p>模型调用卡住三十秒后，运行时发起第二次请求；第一请求随后返回，两个结果又各自触发工具。这个事故不是“网络不稳定”，而是系统没有统一的时间与取消语义。重试、超时和取消必须作为一个协议设计，因为任何一个单独存在都会在其他两个边界制造幽灵工作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>超时定义一次等待何时不再值得继续，重试决定失败后是否再次尝试，取消把“不再需要结果”传播给正在消耗资源的下游。三者共享同一个上层 deadline 和尝试预算。若各层各设独立时钟，上游可能早已放弃，下游仍在运行；若各层各自重试，调用数量会呈乘法增长。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    Run[运行总截止时间] --&gt; Step[步骤时间片]&#10;    Step --&gt; Attempt1[尝试一]&#10;    Attempt1 --&gt;|可重试故障| Backoff[退避与抖动]&#10;    Backoff --&gt; Budget{预算仍充足}&#10;    Budget --&gt;|是| Attempt2[尝试二]&#10;    Budget --&gt;|否| Stop[停止自动恢复]&#10;    Run --&gt;|取消| Token[取消令牌]&#10;    Token --&gt; Attempt1&#10;    Token --&gt; Attempt2&#10;    Token --&gt; Cleanup[清理与对账]\">flowchart TD\n    Run[运行总截止时间] --&gt; Step[步骤时间片]\n    Step --&gt; Attempt1[尝试一]\n    Attempt1 --&gt;|可重试故障| Backoff[退避与抖动]\n    Backoff --&gt; Budget{预算仍充足}\n    Budget --&gt;|是| Attempt2[尝试二]\n    Budget --&gt;|否| Stop[停止自动恢复]\n    Run --&gt;|取消| Token[取消令牌]\n    Token --&gt; Attempt1\n    Token --&gt; Attempt2\n    Token --&gt; Cleanup[清理与对账]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>故障类别</th>\n<th>典型例子</th>\n<th>默认策略</th>\n<th>关键证据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>瞬时传输故障</td>\n<td>连接重置、短暂不可达</td>\n<td>同身份有界重试</td>\n<td>尝试与延迟记录</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过载与限流</td>\n<td><code>429</code>、队列饱和</td>\n<td>遵守提示、退避、降载</td>\n<td><code>Retry-After</code>、队列年龄</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>永久请求错误</td>\n<td>schema、权限、资源不存在</td>\n<td>快速失败或改计划</td>\n<td>结构化错误码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>业务冲突</td>\n<td>余额不足、版本冲突</td>\n<td>重新读取事实再决策</td>\n<td>业务对象版本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结果未知</td>\n<td>请求发出后超时</td>\n<td>查询回执或同键重送</td>\n<td>动作身份、外部效果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>本地取消</td>\n<td>用户撤销、预算耗尽</td>\n<td>传播取消并对账</td>\n<td>取消原因与发起者</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>AWS Well-Architected 的重试指南强调指数退避、抖动与最大重试值，指出无界队列和多层重试会让过载恶化。<a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/wellarchitected/latest/framework/rel_mitigate_interaction_failure_limit_retries.html\">REL05-BP03</a>还要求只重试可安全重复的请求。这些原则对 LLM 更重要，因为一次失败尝试可能已经消耗大量 token，甚至已触发外部工具。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从运行截止时间向下切片\">从运行截止时间向下切片</h2><p>时间控制应从用户或业务给出的绝对截止时间开始。每个步骤获得剩余时间的一部分，每次尝试再从步骤预算中切片，并预留保存回执、取消传播和人工接管所需时间。绝对时间比“再等三十秒”更适合跨进程恢复，因为恢复后仍能计算真实剩余量。</p>\n<p>可以用以下约束检查时间分配：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≥</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{run} \\geq \\sum_{i=1}^{n}(T_{step_i} + T_{persist_i}) + T_{recovery}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">eco</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>单步内部的尝试预算则满足：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≥</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>f</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{step} \\geq \\sum_{j=1}^{m}(T_{attempt_j} + T_{backoff_j}) + T_{reconcile}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0652em;vertical-align:-1.4138em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4138em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">tt</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span clas