ist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2819em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3473em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">eco</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>公式不是要求所有步骤串行，而是提醒架构师把持久化与对账时间算进预算。若最后一次工具尝试刚好耗尽运行期限，系统就没有时间确认效果或安全取消。</p>\n<p>不同依赖需要不同超时。模型首 token 延迟、完整响应时间、流式空闲时间和工具执行时间不是同一个指标。对模型流可设置首事件 deadline 与事件间 idle timeout；对长工具设置启动超时、心跳超时和总体超时；对审批设置到期时间而不是占用执行线程。</p>\n<p>gRPC 的核心语义指出，客户端和服务端可能对同一次 RPC 得出不同结论：服务端已经成功发送，客户端却因 deadline 认为失败；取消也不会回滚此前已发生的改变。<a href=\"https://grpc.io/docs/what-is-grpc/core-concepts/\">gRPC Core Concepts</a>说明为什么“deadline exceeded”必须和副作用回执配合，而不能直接重发新动作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"重试策略由错误分类驱动\">重试策略由错误分类驱动</h2><p>重试函数的输入不应只有异常类型，还应包含动作可重试性、剩余时间、累计成本、供应商提示、当前过载状态和先前尝试轨迹。策略返回重试、对账、改计划、等待或终止，而不是一个布尔值。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"export type RetryContext = {&#10;  actionId: string;&#10;  attempt: number;&#10;  elapsedMs: number;&#10;  remainingMs: number;&#10;  costUsed: number;&#10;  errorClass: &#39;transient&#39; | &#39;overload&#39; | &#39;permanent&#39; | &#39;conflict&#39; | &#39;unknown&#39;;&#10;  idempotent: boolean;&#10;  retryAfterMs: number | null;&#10;};&#10;&#10;export type RetryDecision =&#10;  { kind: &#39;retry&#39;; delayMs: number } | { kind: &#39;reconcile&#39; } | { kind: &#39;replan&#39; } | { kind: &#39;stop&#39;; reason: string };&#10;&#10;export function decideRetry(input: RetryContext): RetryDecision {&#10;  if (input.remainingMs &lt;= 0 || input.attempt &gt;= 4) return { kind: &#39;stop&#39;, reason: &#39;budget_exhausted&#39; };&#10;  if (input.errorClass === &#39;unknown&#39;) return { kind: &#39;reconcile&#39; };&#10;  if (input.errorClass === &#39;permanent&#39;) return { kind: &#39;stop&#39;, reason: &#39;permanent_error&#39; };&#10;  if (!input.idempotent) return { kind: &#39;reconcile&#39; };&#10;  const cap = Math.min(8000, 250 * 2 ** input.attempt);&#10;  const delayMs = input.retryAfterMs ?? Math.floor(Math.random() * cap);&#10;  return delayMs &lt; input.remainingMs ? { kind: &#39;retry&#39;, delayMs } : { kind: &#39;stop&#39;, reason: &#39;deadline&#39; };&#10;}\"><pre cla